---
// CortexDC 專屬視覺化 section — 不放在 MDX 裡以保持 Keystatic 相容
---

<div class="space-y-24">

  <!-- 圖分析引擎：左文右動圖 -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <p class="readout text-brand-2">GRAPH ANALYTICS ENGINE</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tx md:text-4xl">一張圖，同時回答三個問題</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">
        基於 Apache AGE 圖資料庫，將機架、服務、電力、網路、合約收斂成一張可查詢的拓樸圖。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- 左：三種模式說明，會跟著動畫高亮 -->
      <div class="space-y-4" id="graph-modes">
        <div class="graph-mode-card active rounded-2xl border-2 border-brand bg-brand/5 p-6 transition-all duration-500" data-mode="0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-xs font-bold text-white">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">衝擊分析</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand">Impact Analysis</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">一台設備下線，哪些業務服務會受影響？數秒內追蹤下游依賴，計算影響範圍。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="graph-mode-card rounded-2xl border-2 border-line-light bg-bg p-6 transition-all duration-500" data-mode="1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg-3 text-xs font-bold text-tx-muted">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">關聯分析</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-tx-muted">Correlation Analysis</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">服務 / 資產 / 機架 / 電力路徑的相依關係，為備援規劃與維護策略提供依據。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="graph-mode-card rounded-2xl border-2 border-line-light bg-bg p-6 transition-all duration-500" data-mode="2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg-3 text-xs font-bold text-tx-muted">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-tx">根因分析</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-tx-muted">Root Cause Analysis</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">從告警反向追蹤事件鏈，自動定位源頭節點，並產生事件報告。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右：動態拓樸圖 -->
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-ink p-6 shadow-xl" style="min-height:380px">
        <svg id="graph-svg" viewBox="0 0 340 300" class="w-full max-w-sm" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <!-- 邊線 -->
          <g id="graph-edges" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
            <!-- App → Svc A, Svc B -->
            <line id="e-app-svca" x1="170" y1="38" x2="90" y2="95" stroke="#25303f"/>
            <line id="e-app-svcb" x1="170" y1="38" x2="250" y2="95" stroke="#25303f"/>
            <!-- Svc A → Srv1 -->
            <line id="e-svca-srv1" x1="90" y1="110" x2="70" y2="168" stroke="#25303f"/>
            <!-- Svc B → Srv2 -->
            <line id="e-svcb-srv2" x1="250" y1="110" x2="270" y2="168" stroke="#25303f"/>
            <!-- Srv1 → Switch -->
            <line id="e-srv1-sw" x1="70" y1="183" x2="140" y2="228" stroke="#25303f"/>
            <!-- Srv2 → Switch -->
            <line id="e-srv2-sw" x1="270" y1="183" x2="200" y2="228" stroke="#25303f"/>
            <!-- Switch → PDU -->
            <line id="e-sw-pdu" x1="170" y1="243" x2="170" y2="273" stroke="#25303f"/>
          </g>

          <!-- 節點 -->
          <!-- App 服務 (頂部) -->
          <g id="n-app" class="graph-node">
            <circle cx="170" cy="28" r="20" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="170" y="32" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">APP</text>
          </g>
          <!-- Service A -->
          <g id="n-svca" class="graph-node">
            <circle cx="90" cy="102" r="18" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="90" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">SVC-A</text>
          </g>
          <!-- Service B -->
          <g id="n-svcb" class="graph-node">
            <circle cx="250" cy="102" r="18" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="250" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">SVC-B</text>
          </g>
          <!-- Server 1 -->
          <g id="n-srv1" class="graph-node">
            <rect x="45" y="168" width="50" height="30" rx="5" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="70" y="187" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">SRV-1</text>
          </g>
          <!-- Server 2 -->
          <g id="n-srv2" class="graph-node">
            <rect x="245" y="168" width="50" height="30" rx="5" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="270" y="187" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">SRV-2</text>
          </g>
          <!-- Switch -->
          <g id="n-sw" class="graph-node">
            <rect x="143" y="228" width="54" height="28" rx="5" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="170" y="246" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">SW</text>
          </g>
          <!-- PDU -->
          <g id="n-pdu" class="graph-node">
            <rect x="148" y="273" width="44" height="22" rx="4" fill="#162e2b" stroke="#25303f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="170" y="288" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7fb5b2" font-family="monospace">PDU</text>
          </g>

          <!-- 動畫狀態：mode-0 衝擊分析 — Server1 告警 → 向上擴散 -->
          <g id="anim-impact" opacity="1">
            <!-- alert ring on SRV-1 -->
            <circle cx="70" cy="183" r="28" fill="none" stroke="#f87171" stroke-width="1" opacity="0">
              <animate attributeName="r" values="26;38;26" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.8;0;0.8" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
            <circle cx="70" cy="183" r="8" fill="#f87171" opacity="0">
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;0.4;1" dur="1.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
            <!-- cascade line srv1→svca -->
            <line x1="70" y1="183" x2="90" y2="110" stroke="#f87171" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 3" opacity="0">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" values="0;-18" dur="0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </line>
            <!-- cascade line svca→app -->
            <line x1="90" y1="110" x2="170" y2="38" stroke="#f87171" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 3" opacity="0">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" values="0;-18" dur="0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </line>
            <!-- affected nodes -->
            <circle cx="90" cy="102" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#f87171" stroke-width="2" opacity="0"/>
            <circle cx="170" cy="28" r="24" fill="none" stroke="#fb923c" stroke-width="2" opacity="0"/>
          </g>

          <!-- 動畫狀態：mode-1 關聯分析 — 橫向關聯高亮 -->
          <g id="anim-correlation" opacity="0">
            <line x1="90" y1="102" x2="250" y2="102" stroke="#1aafa8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 3">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" values="0;-16" dur="1s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </line>
            <line x1="70" y1="183" x2="270" y2="183" stroke="#1aafa8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 3">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" values="0;-16" dur="1s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </line>
            <circle cx="90" cy="102" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#1aafa8" stroke-width="2">
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
            <circle cx="250" cy="102" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#1aafa8" stroke-width="2">
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="1.5s" begin="0.3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
          </g>

          <!-- 動畫狀態：mode-2 根因分析 — 從告警往下追 -->
          <g id="anim-rootcause" opacity="0">
            <circle cx="170" cy="28" r="24" fill="none" stroke="#fb923c" stroke-width="2">
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;0.3;1" dur="1s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
            <line x1="170" y1="38" x2="90" y2="95" stroke="#fb923c" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 3">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" values="-18;0" dur="0.7s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </line>
            <line x1="90" y1="110" x2="70" y2="168" stroke="#fb923c" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 3">
              <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" values="-18;0" dur="0.7s" begin="0.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </line>
            <!-- root cause glow -->
            <circle cx="70" cy="183" r="30" fill="#f87171" opacity="0">
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;0.15;0" dur="1.2s" begin="0.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
            <circle cx="70" cy="183" r="10" fill="#f87171" opacity="0">
              <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;0.9;0" dur="1.2s" begin="0.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
            </circle>
          </g>

          <!-- 模式標籤 -->
          <text id="graph-label" x="170" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#1aafa8" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="1">IMPACT ANALYSIS</text>
        </svg>

        <!-- 模式指示點 -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-0 right-0 flex justify-center gap-2">
          <button class="graph-dot h-2 w-6 rounded-full bg-brand transition-all" data-mode="0"></button>
          <button class="graph-dot h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line opacity-50 transition-all" data-mode="1"></button>
          <button class="graph-dot h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line opacity-50 transition-all" data-mode="2"></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const MODES = [
      { label: 'IMPACT ANALYSIS',      card: 0 },
      { label: 'CORRELATION ANALYSIS', card: 1 },
      { label: 'ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS',  card: 2 },
    ];
    const anims   = ['anim-impact','anim-correlation','anim-rootcause'];
    const cards   = document.querySelectorAll('.graph-mode-card');
    const dots    = document.querySelectorAll('.graph-dot');
    const labelEl = document.getElementById('graph-label');
    let current = 0;

    function setMode(idx) {
      current = idx;
      // 動畫圖層
      anims.forEach((id, i) => {
        const el = document.getElementById(id);
        if (el) el.setAttribute('opacity', i === idx ? '1' : '0');
      });
      // 左側卡片高亮
      cards.forEach((c, i) => {
        if (i === idx) {
          c.classList.add('border-brand','bg-brand/5');
          c.classList.remove('border-line-light','bg-bg');
          c.querySelector('.rounded-full')?.classList.replace('bg-bg-3','bg-brand');
          c.querySelector('.rounded-full')?.classList.replace('text-tx-muted','text-white');
          c.querySelector('p.text-sm.font-medium')?.classList.replace('text-tx-muted','text-brand');
        } else {
          c.classList.remove('border-brand','bg-brand/5');
          c.classList.add('border-line-light','bg-bg');
          c.querySelector('.rounded-full')?.classList.replace('bg-brand','bg-bg-3');
          c.querySelector('.rounded-full')?.classList.replace('text-white','text-tx-muted');
          c.querySelector('p.text-sm.font-medium')?.classList.replace('text-brand','text-tx-muted');
        }
      });
      // 指示點
      dots.forEach((d, i) => {
        d.classList.toggle('w-6', i === idx);
        d.classList.toggle('w-2', i !== idx);
        d.classList.toggle('bg-brand', i === idx);
        d.classList.toggle('bg-line', i !== idx);
        d.classList.toggle('opacity-50', i !== idx);
      });
      // 標籤
      if (labelEl) labelEl.textContent = MODES[idx].label;
    }

    // 自動循環
    let timer = setInterval(() => setMode((current + 1) % 3), 3000);

    // 點擊切換
    dots.forEach(d => d.addEventListener('click', () => {
      clearInterval(timer);
      setMode(parseInt(d.dataset.mode));
      timer = setInterval(() => setMode((current + 1) % 3), 3000);
    }));
    cards.forEach(c => c.addEventListener('click', () => {
      clearInterval(timer);
      setMode(parseInt(c.dataset.mode));
      timer = setInterval(() => setMode((current + 1) % 3), 3000);
    }));
  </script>

  <!-- 8 大協定 -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="readout text-brand-2">PROTOCOL SUPPORT</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tx">8 大協定，18 個收集器</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">一條事件流收斂所有設備資料，無論品牌、廠商、協定。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line-light shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">Redfish (HTTPS)</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">iLO / iDRAC / BMC</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">伺服器硬體監控</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg-2 px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">SNMP v1/v2c/v3</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">交換器 / PDU / UPS</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">網路設備監控</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">IPMI / RMCP</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">伺服器 BMC</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">硬體管理</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg-2 px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">Modbus TCP</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">PDU / 環境感測器</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">工業設備</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">BACnet/IP</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">HVAC / 電力系統</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">樓控設備</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg-2 px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">MQTT</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">IoT 感測器</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">IoT 資料匯入</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">SSH</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">網路設備 CLI</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">指令列採集</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-bg-2 px-6 py-4">
        <span class="w-44 shrink-0 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-brand">RTSP</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-sm text-tx">IP Camera</span>
        <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-2 sm:block">影像串流監控</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 週 PoC -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="readout text-brand-2">PROOF OF CONCEPT</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-tx">4 週，從環境到客戶匯報</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-tx-muted">標準化 PoC 範本，讓客戶在一個月內看到真實成效。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-xs font-bold text-white">1</span>
          <div><p class="readout text-tx-muted">第 1 週</p><p class="font-semibold text-tx">環境部署</p></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>硬體驗收</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>容器部署</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>TLS 憑證</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>RBAC 規劃</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span>
          <div><p class="readout text-tx-muted">第 2 週</p><p class="font-semibold text-tx">協定接入</p></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>Redfish iLO/iDRAC</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>SNMP 交換器</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>Modbus PDU</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>MQTT 感測器</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-xs font-bold text-white">3</span>
          <div><p class="readout text-tx-muted">第 3 週</p><p class="font-semibold text-tx">Canvas 拓樸</p></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>平面圖 Canvas</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>機架正背面視圖</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>資產關係</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-tx-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>IP 管理</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-light bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-xs font-bold text-white">4</span>
          <div><p class="readout text-tx-muted">第 4 週</p><p class="font-semibold text-tx">報表與匯報</p></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
